{"id":"wb-7-897","name":"太原文庙","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T13:25:15+00:00","status":"ready","title":"太原府文庙","text":"太原府文庙，位于中国山西省太原市迎泽区文庙街道上官巷东端，是清代太原府的府学文庙，最早兴建于金代，清光绪七年毁于洪水，次年择地重建。现为全国重点文物保护单位，山西省民俗博物馆所在地。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%A4%AA%E5%8E%9F%E5%BA%9C%E6%96%87%E5%BA%99","revisionId":94952005,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=94952005","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"复核百科重定向、文物名称与同一地点；引用版本已锁定","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/d159a22ca97013929013b5d3.jpg","title":"Taiyuan_Confucian_Temple_2012-09.JPG","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Taiyuan_Confucian_Temple_2012-09.JPG","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/3/3b/Taiyuan_Confucian_Temple_2012-09.JPG?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"猫猫的日记本","license":"CC BY-SA 3.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0","caption":"​太原府文庙牌坊。","width":320,"height":240,"matchEvidence":"已复核文物对应百科条目的主图","subject":"太原府文庙"}}